<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Genius"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Genius (feat. Sia, Diplo &amp; Labrinth)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Sia"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Diplo"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Labrinth"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="LSD"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Genius"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USQX91800798"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1455271210"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="556203261"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="001Hb8ZS3w1N6M"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="4xigPf2sigSPmuFH3qCelB"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="25745812"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="marcosteam"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Philip Meckseper</songwriter><songwriter>Sia</songwriter><songwriter>Thomas Wesley Pentz</songwriter><songwriter>Timothy Mckenzie</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:28.660"><div begin="0.231" end="3:28.660"><p begin="0.231" end="1.119" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0.231" end="1.119">Labrinth</span></p><p begin="1.194" end="2.779" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1.194" end="1.294">Do</span> <span begin="1.294" end="1.465">you</span> <span begin="1.465" end="1.673">think</span> <span begin="1.673" end="1.839">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1.839" end="2.779">stupid?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否觉得我很愚蠢</span></p><p begin="4.206" end="5.591" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4.206" end="4.306">Do</span> <span begin="4.306" end="4.536">you</span> <span begin="4.536" end="4.738">think</span> <span begin="4.738" end="4.917">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="4.917" end="5.137">bat-</span><span begin="5.137" end="5.351" amll:obscene="true">shit</span> <span begin="5.351" end="5.591">crazy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否觉得我为你丧失理智</span></p><p begin="5.601" end="7.267" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5.601" end="6.014">Having</span> <span begin="6.014" end="6.145">you</span> <span begin="6.145" end="6.306">on</span> <span begin="6.306" end="6.496">my</span> <span begin="6.496" end="7.267">mind?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时刻将你记挂在脑海</span></p><p begin="7.277" end="9.027" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.277" end="7.458">Do</span> <span begin="7.458" end="7.655">you</span> <span begin="7.655" end="7.875">think</span> <span begin="7.875" end="8.035">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="8.035" end="9.027">helpless?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否觉得我孤立无援</span></p><p begin="10.188" end="13.180" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.188" end="10.572">My</span> <span begin="10.572" end="11.113">algebra</span> <span begin="11.113" end="11.369">gon&apos;</span> <span begin="11.369" end="11.708">equal</span> <span begin="11.708" end="12.083">you</span> <span begin="12.083" end="12.463">every</span> <span begin="12.463" end="13.180">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你与我的代数结果每一次都完美匹配契合</span></p><p begin="13.190" end="15.035" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.190" end="13.365">Do</span> <span begin="13.365" end="13.627">you</span> <span begin="13.627" end="13.847">think</span> <span begin="13.847" end="14.044">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="14.044" end="15.035">calling?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否听见我的呼唤</span></p><p begin="16.279" end="17.367" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.279" end="16.379">Do</span> <span begin="16.379" end="16.514">you</span> <span begin="16.514" end="16.722">think</span> <span begin="16.722" end="16.912">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="16.912" end="17.367">calling</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否听见每个夜晚</span></p><p begin="17.181" end="19.217" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.181" end="17.565">Out</span> <span begin="17.565" end="17.767">your</span> <span begin="17.767" end="18.136">name</span> <span begin="18.136" end="18.457">every</span> <span begin="18.457" end="19.217">night?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都在呼唤你的姓名</span></p><p begin="19.227" end="26.628" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.227" end="19.593">Girl,</span> <span begin="19.593" end="19.896">I</span> <span begin="19.896" end="20.092">have</span> <span begin="20.092" end="20.658">fallen</span> <span begin="20.658" end="22.314">for</span> <span begin="22.740" end="25.612">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">女孩 我早已爱上了你</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="25.622" end="26.628"><span begin="25.622" end="25.831">(What,</span> <span begin="25.988" end="26.208">what</span> <span begin="26.208" end="26.327">you</span> <span begin="26.327" end="26.628">say?)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等等 你说什幺</span></span></p><p begin="26.638" end="31.225" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="26.638" end="27.176">Oh</span> <span begin="27.176" end="27.545">my</span> <span begin="27.545" end="28.587">God,</span> <span begin="28.717" end="29.086">baby,</span> <span begin="29.086" end="29.467">baby,</span> <span begin="29.467" end="29.705">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="29.705" end="29.818">you</span> <span begin="29.818" end="31.225">see?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦我的天哪 亲爱的 你难道不曾看见</span></p><p begin="31.505" end="34.162" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="31.505" end="31.996">I</span> <span begin="31.996" end="32.132">got</span> <span begin="32.132" end="32.591">everything</span> <span begin="32.591" end="32.691">you</span> <span begin="32.691" end="34.162">need</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我得到了你需要的一切</span></p><p begin="35.333" end="39.530" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.333" end="35.800">O-</span><span begin="35.800" end="36.413">only</span> <span begin="36.413" end="36.615">a</span> <span begin="36.615" end="37.380">genius</span> <span begin="37.380" end="37.638">could</span> <span begin="37.638" end="37.965">love</span> <span begin="37.965" end="38.106">a</span> <span begin="38.106" end="38.489">woman</span> <span begin="38.489" end="38.840">like</span> <span begin="38.840" end="39.530">she</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许只有 只有天才才会爱上如她一般的女孩</span></p><p begin="38.845" end="43.467" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="38.845" end="39.348">Oh</span> <span begin="39.348" end="39.711">my</span> <span begin="39.711" end="40.600">God,</span> <span begin="40.692" end="41.061">baby,</span> <span begin="41.061" end="41.442">baby,</span> <span begin="41.442" end="41.686">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="41.686" end="41.793">you</span> <span begin="41.793" end="43.467">see?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦我的天哪 亲爱的 你难道不曾看见</span></p><p begin="43.733" end="46.448" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="43.733" end="43.962">I</span> <span begin="43.962" end="44.170">got</span> <span begin="44.170" end="44.765">everything</span> <span begin="44.765" end="44.865">you</span> <span begin="44.865" end="46.448">need</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我得到了你需要的一切</span></p><p begin="47.500" end="51.537" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.500" end="47.690">O-</span><span begin="47.690" end="47.856">o-</span><span begin="47.856" end="48.375">only</span> <span begin="48.375" end="48.619">a</span> <span begin="48.619" end="49.436">genius</span> <span begin="49.436" end="49.654">could</span> <span begin="49.654" end="49.953">love</span> <span begin="49.953" e