pan></p><p begin="1:07.402" end="1:08.882" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.402" end="1:07.786">Ge-</span><span begin="1:07.786" end="1:08.120">ge-</span><span begin="1:08.120" end="1:08.882">genius</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天 天 天才</span></p><p begin="1:08.798" end="1:10.429" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.798" end="1:09.105">A</span> <span begin="1:09.105" end="1:09.439">ge-</span><span begin="1:09.439" end="1:09.804">ge-</span><span begin="1:09.804" end="1:10.156">ge-</span><span begin="1:10.156" end="1:10.429">ge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那个天 天 天 天</span></p><p begin="1:10.397" end="1:11.932" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.397" end="1:10.821">Ge-</span><span begin="1:10.821" end="1:11.141">ge-</span><span begin="1:11.141" end="1:11.932">genius</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天 天 天才</span></p><p begin="1:11.666" end="1:15.769" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.335" end="1:13.557">&apos;Cause</span> <span begin="1:13.557" end="1:13.824">I</span> <span begin="1:13.824" end="1:14.141">love</span> <span begin="1:14.141" end="1:14.326">a</span> <span begin="1:14.326" end="1:14.724">woman</span> <span begin="1:14.724" end="1:15.107">like</span> <span begin="1:15.107" end="1:15.769">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为爱上了一个如你一般的女人</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:11.666" end="1:13.809"><span begin="1:11.666" end="1:11.887">(He-</span><span begin="1:11.887" end="1:12.122">he-</span><span begin="1:12.252" end="1:12.555">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:12.555" end="1:12.740">a</span> <span begin="1:12.740" end="1:13.809">genius)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他就是那个天才</span></span></p><p begin="1:20.286" end="1:21.580" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.286" end="1:21.580">Sia</span></p><p begin="1:20.286" end="1:22.575" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v2"><